{"4018060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Summer Delusion: The Girl Only I Can See", "steam_appid": 4018060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras/ea57d716193dfc2f6d8dceaf2fda9fd2.avif?t=1787663001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras_big/ea57d716193dfc2f6d8dceaf2fda9fd2.webp?t=1787663001 width=1560 height=769 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;They said my illness is almost cured.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, the only one who never left my side... she is about to disappear forever.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Haunting Summer You’ll Never Forget</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thought I was losing my mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The doctor gave me the diagnosis,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the girl beside me whispered softly:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“You’re not sick. You just see what others can’t.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The doctor placed the pills in my hands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The girl is a delusion. Take your medication and you'll recover soon.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is my friend just a figment of my imagination? Or is she really from another realm?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This summer, beneath the bright sky and endless sea,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ll discover what’s real... and what’s not.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras/b692f695b3d523174e119c9b18e54e4d.avif?t=1787663001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras_big/b692f695b3d523174e119c9b18e54e4d.webp?t=1787663001 width=1560 height=769 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the doctor’s advice, I came to my uncle’s seaside inn to rest and work part-time. However, what awaits me is not healing, but a cascade of bizarre “hallucinations.” Strange beings whisper in the shadows, and the boundary between reality and illusion begin to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, girls of vastly different personalities begin to enter my life—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >some bright and cheerful, others mysterious… or dangerously alluring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are these also delusions… or more glimpses of a world beyond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whose words can I truly trust?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl who’s always been by my side— should I hold her close… or let her fade away?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the last breeze of summer fades,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth will finally surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 6 romanceable heroines — each with unique personalities, secrets, and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple choices and branching routes — your decisions will shape the story and your destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mystery meets romance — uncover the truth behind illusion, madness, and love.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A beautifully crafted island setting — serene by day, unsettling by night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras/0410a3c7c267d2ce9e2ed7b1fc514aa6.avif?t=1787663001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras_big/0410a3c7c267d2ce9e2ed7b1fc514aa6.webp?t=1787663001 width=1560 height=798 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras/464062c68706f040d114e023fc46e1ca.avif?t=1787663001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras_big/464062c68706f040d114e023fc46e1ca.webp?t=1787663001 width=1560 height=1635 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras/d566b7cdc4e85a54fb945994e074f75e.avif?t=1787663001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras_big/d566b7cdc4e85a54fb945994e074f75e.webp?t=1787663001 width=1560 height=1635 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras/17c20cb2b3b42d0fb94d6b08f728990e.avif?t=1787663001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras_big/17c20cb2b3b42d0fb94d6b08f728990e.webp?t=1787663001 width=1560 height=1635 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras/947fc8bb7944a5fc014aa81204a8aac7.avif?t=1787663001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras_big/947fc8bb7944a5fc014aa81204a8aac7.webp?t=1787663001 width=1560 height=1635 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras/0384794e010084af3cb94c6dbb3d10e9.avif?t=1787663001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras_big/0384794e010084af3cb94c6dbb3d10e9.webp?t=1787663001 width=1560 height=1635 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras/2d7ff299a544795a8656792385869ff4.avif?t=1787663001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap