 my uncle’s seaside inn to rest and work part-time. However, what awaits me is not healing, but a cascade of bizarre “hallucinations.” Strange beings whisper in the shadows, and the boundary between reality and illusion begin to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the same time, girls of vastly different personalities begin to enter my life—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >some bright and cheerful, others mysterious… or dangerously alluring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are these also delusions… or more glimpses of a world beyond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whose words can I truly trust?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl who’s always been by my side— should I hold her close… or let her fade away?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the last breeze of summer fades,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth will finally surface.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 6 romanceable heroines — each with unique personalities, secrets, and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple choices and branching routes — your decisions will shape the story and your destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Mystery meets romance — uncover the truth behind illusion, madness, and love.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A beautifully crafted island setting — serene by day, unsettling by night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras/0410a3c7c267d2ce9e2ed7b1fc514aa6.avif?t=1787663001\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras_big/0410a3c7c267d2ce9e2ed7b1fc514aa6.webp?t=1787663001 width=1560 height=798 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018060/extras/464062c68706f040d114e023fc46e1ca.avif?t=1787663001\"